<BaseLayout
title="Press & Media | Great Gus Productions"
description="Press information, media resources, and contact information for Great Gus Productions.">

<section class="legal-page">
<h1>Press & Media</h1>
<p class="last-updated">Last Updated: March 9, 2026</p>

<div class="legal-content">

<h2>About Great Gus Productions</h2>
<p>
Great Gus Productions is an independent film studio focused on creating
original narrative films and storytelling-driven content. The studio develops,
produces, and distributes films as well as related creative works including
screenplays and merchandise.
</p>

<h2>Press Inquiries</h2>
<p>
For press interviews, media requests, festival inquiries, or collaboration
opportunities, please contact:
</p>

<p>
GREAT GUS PRODUCTIONS LLC<br />
Washington State<br />
<a href="mailto:greatgusproductions@gmail.com">
greatgusproductions@gmail.com
</a>
</p>

<h2>Media Resources</h2>
<p>
Press materials, trailers, and additional resources may be made available upon
request for journalists, festival programmers, and media outlets.
</p>

<h2>Film Information</h2>
<p>
For information about films produced or distributed by Great Gus Productions,
please visit the Films section of this website or contact us directly for
press materials.
</p>

<h2>Usage of Materials</h2>
<p>
Logos, film stills, and promotional materials may be used for editorial and
press coverage purposes with appropriate credit to Great Gus Productions.
Unauthorized commercial use is prohibited.
</p>

<h2>Copyright</h2>
<p>
© 2018–2026 GREAT GUS PRODUCTIONS LLC. All Rights Reserved.
</p>

</div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
.legal-page {
  max-width: 820px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 4rem 1rem 6rem;
}

.legal-page h1 {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 3rem;
  font-size: 2.4rem;
  font-weight: 300;
}

.last-updated {
  margin-top: -2rem;
  margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  text-align: left;
  color: #bdbdbd;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
}

.legal-content h2 {
  color: var(--accent);
font-size: 0.85rem;
